Backport of hyprwm/Hyprland main c7932c6efc69 ("core/output: install cleanup handlers for inert
resources") and 5b6b75ac5fa3 ("core/output: make late bindings to removed outputs inert"), both
2026-10-21, src/ only (their tests/protocols/Output.cpp needs main's test harness). The one
change from upstream: 0.56.2 spells the removed warning Log::logger->log(...), not LOG(...).

A bind to a removed (defunct) wl_output, or to one whose monitor has no backend output any
more, gets an inert resource: no events are sent, outputBound is not emitted, and its release
and destroy handlers are installed so it still drains.
